{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他把眼前要做的事也看成是在护住那种生活，才觉得它离自己近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"离自己近了些\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他一想到那种生活，就想退回安宁守着它。可只退回来，珍惜的东西还是会受损。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再把舍不得当成软弱，这份牵挂反倒给了他往前的劲。\",\n      \"key\": \"往前的劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他往前时仍怕拼命会磨掉温柔，真要付出代价时也可能想退。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"想到那种生活，他又高兴起来，带着这份想念做眼前的事，忙起来也不把它压下去。\",\n      \"key\": \"带着这份想念\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他还不知道努力能护住多少，但愿望没成，也不等于从前那份安宁是假的。\",\n      \"key\": \"安宁是假的\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"那股劲退下后，他不再靠硬撑证明自己该往前，心里仍清楚想护住那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"硬撑证明\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\", \"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把旧愿变近的原因落在眼前的行动上，保留过去想退回安宁的习惯及其局限，再写舍不得如何成为行动动力。合并重复的行动理由，不再替他宣布一套道理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动可能耗损温柔、代价仍会让他动摇的事实，把抽象的坚持原则改成他具体担心的损失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\", \"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并区分\",\n      \"why\": \"分别保留依恋转成行动动力和旧日快乐重新回来。明确他不再把舍不得当成软弱，也能带着想念继续做事，不把两种心意的并存写成彻底和解。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R74\", \"R75\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动可能付出代价、结果仍无保证，以及愿望未成不等于过去的安宁虚假。用具体的担心和真实经历承载不确定性，删去重复的总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R76\", \"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"不再用投入本身的快乐概括最终的取舍，而以温柔可能被耗损的经历说明行动的限度。结尾保留不再靠硬撑自证的变化，并补上冲劲退去后仍想护住什么的明确念头，以解释末尾的收束。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "88718d06-553e-408d-a54b-f0b5397ddf87", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T213354929222Z", "elapsed_seconds": 820.843, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T21:47:35.775269+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cb6ada041582c4393ece9812b5dbc8ae2096f07e14dce66be1ef88f2337315e5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T213354929222Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "15539aa2646f46595b7ac7397653cd24b8a7ab22218a5cf437357ff1db1fcfd1"}}}
